d. curious how much the motion drops vs the full model, or is it mostly just lower res?", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-15T16:30:00.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/miloallennn/status/2122004200460612057", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 36, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121935650245235002", "author_id": "1915750293398282240", "text": "@fal I'm going to ask one more time: are you lying about H3 Max being open source?", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-15T11:57:37.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/NasgorBas1/status/2121935650245235002", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 33, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121933539591749893", "author_id": "870951755965661184", "text": "@fal Fast generation without sacrificing core capabilities is a big win for AI video creators. Native audio, video extension, and reference-based editing make this especially powerful for rapid experimentation and professional workflows. Exciting to see Seedance becoming more", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-15T11:49:14.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/Nely_Brooks/status/2121933539591749893", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121929737367159122", "author_id": "2102577648216240128", "text": "@fal The horse splashing through the dark water looks striking, especially the bright spray against the black background. Did you use a reference frame to keep the movement consistent?", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-15T11:34:07.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/AmaiyaOfficial/status/2121929737367159122", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121925860513230898", "author_id": "1898015443069042688", "text": "@fal fast drafts make testi